                    "propertyValues": {
                        "html": {
                            "type": "TRANSLATION_LITERAL",
                            "value": {
                                "code": null,
                                "comment": "",
                                "message": "<p data-end=\"592\" data-start=\"308\">Email OTP-based MFA is a security mechanism that requires users to enter a one-time passcode (OTP) sent to their registered email address after submitting their username and password. This provides an additional layer of identity verification before granting access to the system.</p>\n<h4 data-end=\"616\" data-start=\"594\"><strong>How It Works</strong>:</h4>\n<ol>\n<li data-end=\"616\" data-start=\"594\">The user logs in with their username and password.</li>\n<li data-end=\"616\" data-start=\"594\">A one-time passcode is sent to their registered email address.</li>\n<li data-end=\"616\" data-start=\"594\">The user retrieves the code from their email and enters it to complete the login process.</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 data-end=\"849\" data-start=\"835\">Advantages:</h4>\n<ul>\n<li data-end=\"849\" data-start=\"835\">Simple to implement without the need for additional hardware or apps.</li>\n<li data-end=\"849\" data-start=\"835\">Suitable for users without smartphones.</li>\n<li data-end=\"849\" data-start=\"835\">Works on any device with email access.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-end=\"1418\" data-start=\"1210\">On the ServiceNow platform, the Email OTP MFA factor can be selectively enforced for specific user groups based on MFA Factor Policies.<br data-end=\"1356\" data-start=\"1353\">For more details, refer to the official <a href=\"/api/now/v1/context_doc_url/mfa-with-email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">product documentation</a>.</p>"
                            }
                        }
                    },
